@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### ============================================================
### Zadanie 4 — brak nakładających się rezerwacji
### Przed uruchomieniem: npm start (czysta pamięć / restart serwera)
### Bazowa rezerwacja: sala 1, 2026-11-10 10:00–12:00 UTC
### ============================================================

### 0) Baza — CONFIRMED 10:00–12:00 (sala 1) → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "reservedBy": "Jan Kowalski",
  "participants": 20,
  "startTime": "2026-11-10T10:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-11-10T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### 1) Stykanie na końcu 12:00–13:00 → 201 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "reservedBy": "Ala Nowak",
  "participants": 5,
  "startTime": "2026-11-10T12:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-11-10T13:00:00.000Z"
}

### 2) Stykanie na początku 08:00–10:00 → 201 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "reservedBy": "Ala Nowak",
  "participants": 5,
  "startTime": "2026-11-10T08:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-11-10T10:00:00.000Z"
}

### 3) Overlap 11:00–13:00 → 409 ROOM_ALREADY_BOOKED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "reservedBy": "Ala Nowak",
  "participants": 5,
  "startTime": "2026-11-10T11:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-11-10T13:00:00.000Z"
}

