### 6) Ta sama godzina, inna sala → 201 OK
# @name createToCancel
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
{
  "roomId": 2,
  "reservedBy": "Ala Nowak",
  "participants": 5,
  "startTime": "2026-11-10T10:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-11-10T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### 7a) Anulowane nie blokują — utwórz na sali 3 → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "roomId": 3,
  "reservedBy": "Temp User",
  "participants": 5,
  "startTime": "2026-12-01T10:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-12-01T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### 7a) Anuluj rezerwację z 7a → 200 CANCELLED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/5/cancel

### 7b) Ta sama sala/godzina po CANCELLED → 201 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "roomId": 2,
  "reservedBy": "New User",
  "participants": 5,
  "startTime": "2026-12-01T10:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-12-01T12:00:00.000Z"
}